# Project Context: Bolt.DIY - AI-Powered Full-Stack Web Development

> **📖 For complete project documentation, see [`context/README.md`](../context/README.md)**

## 🚨 Critical Workflow: Context-First Development (ALWAYS FOLLOW)

**Before starting ANY work:**

1. **Check Context First**
   ```bash
   cd context/ && ls -la | grep "feature-name"
   ```
   - Review what's been done, issues encountered, what needs to be done

2. **Create Context if Missing**
   ```bash
   mkdir context/feature-name
   cp context/CONTEXT_TEMPLATE.md context/feature-name/IMPLEMENTATION.md
   ```

3. **Document Continuously**
   - Update context as you work
   - **Document ALL file changes** (created/modified/deleted) with reasons
   - Include issues and solutions
   - Update what needs to be done next

### File Tracking (MANDATORY)

For EVERY file created/modified/deleted, document:
- **Created**: Path, purpose, why created, key exports
- **Modified**: Path, changes made, why modified, lines changed  
- **Deleted**: Path, why deleted, migration path

